Z||000004||87fiero_gt||01-12-2000||03:03 PM||||I bought the dist from autozone last June. I was going to pull the ignition module and take it to autozone to have it checked. When I pulled the cap, I saw a sticker that said if the module is removed, the warranty is void. So I pulled the whole distributer and Autozone exchanged it. The dist comes with the module and pickup coil. Problem fixed. Ihave been real happy with their service.||||reg||14
